handoff?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. If the AI keeps replying while a person is typing, the customer gets mixed answers. Pause it for a set time for sales handoffs, and until staff turn it back on for complaints and refunds.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can my team reply after the 24-hour window on Messenger?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Meta's Human Agent message tag lets a person reply manually within a separate seven-day period after the customer's last message. Use it for genuine human follow-up, not automated messages.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"AI Chatbot Human Handoff\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-human-handoff\"}]}</script><meta property='og:type' content='article'><meta property='og:site_name' content='Dijae Dadula'><meta property='og:url' content='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-human-handoff'><meta property='og:title' content='When Should an AI Chatbot Hand Off to a Human? A Handoff Playbook'><meta property='og:description' content='When an AI chatbot should hand off to a human: 7 triggers, copy-ready handoff rules, Botcake and Pancake setup, message templates and a handoff test.'><meta property='og:image' content='https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/2c/9a/f3/2b/f5e862b08068eb7305b411693cd39218d7fbd6b1286f2e8f0b35eb1f.png'><meta property='og:image:width' content='1536'><meta property='og:image:height' content='864'><meta property='og:image:alt' content='Illustration of a friendly robot passing a chat bubble to a smiling support agent with a headset, a sm